  "description": "MOCMUQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H74 Eu4 N18 O26. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.842-4.343 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.72-112.95°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Eu4(C11H11N3O4)6(CH3OH)2. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
